     "for": "Either $5x^{3/2}$ or $+\\tfrac{3}{4}x^{-3/2}$ correct, with its coefficient simplified",
     "notes": "Accept $5x^{1.5}$ or $0.75x^{-1.5}$. Accept $5\\sqrt{x^3}$ oe."
    },
