     "step": 1,
     "working": "Divide each term of the numerator by $2x^{1/2}$: $y = \\dfrac{4x^3}{2x^{1/2}} - \\dfrac{3}{2x^{1/2}} = 2x^{5/2} - \\tfrac{3}{2}x^{-1/2}$",
     "mark": "M1 (part)"
    },
    {
     "step": 2,
     "working": "Differentiate each term: $\\dfrac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}x}\\left(2x^{5/2}\\right) = 2 \\times \\tfrac{5}{2}x^{3/2} = 5x^{3/2}$",
     "mark": "M1, A1"
    },
    {
     "step": 3,
     "working": "$\\dfrac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}x}\\left(-\\tfrac{3}{2}x^{-1/2}\\right) = -\\tfrac{3}{2} \\times \\left(-\\tfrac{1}{2}\\right)x^{-3/2} = +\\tfrac{3}{4}x^{-3/2}$",
     "mark": "0"
    },
    {
     "step": 4,
     "working": "$\\dfrac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x} = 5x^{3/2} + \\tfrac{3}{4}x^{-3/2}$",
     "mark": "A1"
    }
   ],
